# make g2 PART=local: smoke test of the driver on the viral DB (not a measurement).
note local smoke test: viral DB, SRR062634 200k pairs; checks the driver, not a result
run mmap SRR062634_200000-gz warm 1 4 2
run mmap SRR062634_200000-fq warm 1 4 2
run madv SRR062634_200000-gz warm 1 2
run load empty warm 1 2
run load SRR062634_200000-gz cold 1 4
